<title>HONG KONG: SiS Int'l interim net rises 29 percent.</title>
<headline>SiS Int'l interim net rises 29 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   5.2	 vs 4.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	 vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  1.57 loss vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    13.17     vs 10.23</p>
<p>    Turnover		     1,055.28  vs 680.27</p>
<p>    Company name		 SiS International Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - SiS International is a wholesale distributor of microcomputer products.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional loss on provision for diminution of investment property.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
